From 65c1061ca1127fa27d72caabf2983e463437e8ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rmp22 <195054967+rmp22@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Feb 2026 10:52:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Add Dynamic Bar

[byben] Squashed from crDroid 17.0 Dynamic Bar series and adapted for LineageOS 24.0:
- merge network_speed/cr_strings entries into existing strings.xml
- add config_currentInfoDivider and config_alternateFastchargeInfoUpdate
- keep NetworkSpeedController CoreStartable binding
- drop AxPlatform hooks and AxAppLockerHelper bindings not present in tree

